{
  "info": {
    "name": "Proyecto BPMN - Flowable REST",
    "description": "Pruebas de la API REST de Flowable para recorrer los escenarios de la consigna.\n\nANTES DE EMPEZAR\n1. Entorno levantado (docker compose up -d, usuarios, BD y despliegue del modelo; ver README.md).\n2. DevNullSmtp abierto (puerto 25, o el de SMTP_PORT) si queres ver los correos a la empresa.\n3. Variables de la coleccion: usuario/clave (por defecto jefeAdmin/test), empresaId (1 o 2: tiene que existir en la BD) y cursoId.\n   Para que el estado final llegue a la tabla curso, el curso tiene que existir. Lo mas simple es crearlo desde http://localhost:3000/solicitar y usar el numero que muestra. Solo con Postman, insertalo antes:\n   docker compose exec -T postgres psql -U institucion -d institucion -c \"insert into curso (id, empresa_id, tematica, descripcion, cantidad_participantes, fechas_preferidas) values (101, 2, 'Prueba', 'x', 3, 'pronto')\"\n4. Los requests de despliegue, DMN y timers usan rest-admin/test (ya configurado en cada uno).\n\nFLUJO TIPICO\n- Instancias > Iniciar por mensaje: guarda sola processInstanceId.\n- Tareas > Listar tareas de la instancia / Buscar tarea por clave: guarda sola taskId. Reclamar y Completar usan {{taskId}}.\n- Comunicaciones de la empresa: cada request busca solo la ejecucion correcta (no hay que copiar executionId).\nSi una comunicacion no esta habilitada, el request falla con 404 y la consola de Postman (View > Show Postman Console) explica por que.\n\nPara empezar de cero: Instancias > Borrar TODAS las instancias activas de Process_Curso.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "basic",
    "basic": [
      {
        "key": "username",
        "value": "{{usuario}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "password",
        "value": "{{clave}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/flowable-rest/service"
    },
    {
      "key": "dmnUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/flowable-rest/dmn-api"
    },
    {
      "key": "usuario",
      "value": "jefeAdmin"
    },
    {
      "key": "clave",
      "value": "test"
    },
    {
      "key": "processKey",
      "value": "Process_Curso"
    },
    {
      "key": "empresaId",
      "value": "2"
    },
    {
      "key": "cursoId",
      "value": "101"
    },
    {
      "key": "processInstanceId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "taskKey",
      "value": "Propuesta"
    },
    {
      "key": "taskId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "executionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mensaje",
      "value": "Aceptación"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Identidad",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "identity",
                "users"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar grupos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/groups",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "identity",
                "groups"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Miembros del grupo administracion",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/users?memberOfGroup=administracion",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "identity",
                "users"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "memberOfGroup",
                  "value": "administracion"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Miembros del grupo docentes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/identity/users?memberOfGroup=docentes",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "identity",
                "users"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "memberOfGroup",
                  "value": "docentes"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Despliegue",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Desplegar BPMN / DMN",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/repository/deployments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "repository",
                "deployments"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Elegi en \"file\" modelo/Proyecto_Organizacion_cursos.bpmn20.xml. La DMN (modelo/viabilidadCurso.dmn) va por \"6. Viabilidad y plazos > Desplegar DMN (motor DMN)\" y DEBE desplegarse antes que el modelo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                }
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "rest-admin",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "test",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar despliegues",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/repository/deployments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "repository",
                "deployments"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar definiciones del proceso",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/repository/process-definitions?key={{processKey}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "repository",
                "process-definitions"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "{{processKey}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Instancias",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Iniciar por clave",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"processDefinitionKey\": \"{{processKey}}\",\n  \"variables\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"simularFaltaAulas\",\n      \"value\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/process-instances",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "process-instances"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Alternativa de pruebas: inicia por clave de proceso, sin empresaId ni cursoId. Preferi \"Iniciar por mensaje\", que es como lo hace el sitio."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Instancia creada (201)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('processInstanceId', j.id);",
                  "console.log('processInstanceId = ' + j.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar por mensaje Solicitud de curso",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Solicitud de curso\",\n  \"businessKey\": \"{{cursoId}}\",\n  \"variables\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"cursoId\",\n      \"value\": {{cursoId}},\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"empresaId\",\n      \"value\": {{empresaId}},\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/process-instances",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "process-instances"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verificado: Flowable 6.8 acepta \"message\" (el nombre, no el id Msg_sol). La regla DMN rechaza el inicio si ya hay 5 otras instancias de Process_Curso sin finalizar: la instancia termina NO_VIABLE."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Instancia creada (201)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('processInstanceId', j.id);",
                  "console.log('processInstanceId = ' + j.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar instancias en curso",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/process-instances",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "process-instances"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ver variables de una instancia",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/process-instances/{{processInstanceId}}/variables",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "process-instances",
                "{{processInstanceId}}",
                "variables"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Instancias no finalizadas (historial)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/history/historic-process-instances?finished=false",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "history",
                "historic-process-instances"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "finished",
                  "value": "false"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Borrar una instancia",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/process-instances/{{processInstanceId}}?deleteReason=prueba",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "process-instances",
                "{{processInstanceId}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "deleteReason",
                  "value": "prueba"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Borrar TODAS las instancias activas de Process_Curso",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/process-instances?processDefinitionKey={{processKey}}&size=100",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "process-instances"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "processDefinitionKey",
                  "value": "{{processKey}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "size",
                  "value": "100"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Recorre las instancias activas y las borra una por una. Usalo antes de cada escenario: las instancias viejas cuentan para el limite de 5 cursos."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const base = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl');",
                  "const auth = 'Basic ' + CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(pm.collectionVariables.get('usuario') + ':' + pm.collectionVariables.get('clave')));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "data.forEach(i => pm.sendRequest({ url: base + '/runtime/process-instances/' + i.id + '?deleteReason=limpieza', method: 'DELETE', header: { Authorization: auth } }));",
                  "console.log('Instancias borradas: ' + data.length);",
                  "pm.test('Se pidio borrar ' + data.length + ' instancia(s)', () => pm.expect(data).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Tareas",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar tareas de la instancia",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks?processInstanceId={{processInstanceId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "processInstanceId",
                  "value": "{{processInstanceId}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Muestra (en la consola de Postman) todas las tareas abiertas de la instancia con su taskDefinitionKey y assignee. Si hay una sola, guarda taskId."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "data.forEach(x => console.log(x.taskDefinitionKey + ' | ' + x.name + ' | assignee=' + x.assignee + ' | id=' + x.id));",
                  "if (data.length === 1) { pm.collectionVariables.set('taskId', data[0].id); pm.collectionVariables.set('taskKey', data[0].taskDefinitionKey); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar tarea por clave (taskKey)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks?processInstanceId={{processInstanceId}}&taskDefinitionKey={{taskKey}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "processInstanceId",
                  "value": "{{processInstanceId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "taskDefinitionKey",
                  "value": "{{taskKey}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Claves: Propuesta, Enviar, Revisar, Archivar, Lista, Material, Activity_12i2hpf (Evaluar Recursos), Virtual, Equipo, Activity_1018bdz (Definir docente), Dictar, Informe, EnviarInforme, Activity_1m08pcl (Liberar Equipamiento). Cambia la variable taskKey y guarda sola taskId."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data || [];",
                  "pm.test('Hay exactamente una tarea con esa clave', () => pm.expect(data.length).to.eql(1));",
                  "if (data.length === 1) pm.collectionVariables.set('taskId', data[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mis tareas asignadas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks?assignee={{usuario}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "assignee",
                  "value": "{{usuario}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tareas candidatas del grupo administracion",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks?candidateGroup=administracion",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "candidateGroup",
                  "value": "administracion"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tareas candidatas del grupo docentes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks?candidateGroup=docentes",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "candidateGroup",
                  "value": "docentes"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reclamar tarea (claim)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"claim\",\n  \"assignee\": \"{{usuario}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks",
                "{{taskId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reclama la tarea {{taskId}} para {{usuario}}. Solo las tareas del grupo se reclaman; las asignadas a una persona no."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Completar tarea",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"complete\",\n  \"variables\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks",
                "{{taskId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Completar Evaluar Recursos (aula, virtual y equipamiento)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks",
                "{{taskId}}"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"complete\",\n  \"variables\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"requiereAula\",\n      \"value\": true,\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"requierePlataforma\",\n      \"value\": true,\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"requiereEquipamiento\",\n      \"value\": true,\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "taskKey Activity_12i2hpf. Hay que mandar las tres banderas y al menos una en true; si no, el motor responde 500. Para falta de aulas, iniciar la instancia con simularFaltaAulas=true."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Completar Definir docente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/tasks/{{taskId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "tasks",
                "{{taskId}}"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"complete\",\n  \"variables\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"docenteSeleccionado\",\n      \"value\": \"docente1\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "taskKey Activity_1018bdz. Usar como jefeDocente (cambia la variable usuario). Requiere que la instancia tenga fechaCurso."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Comunicaciones de la empresa",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Buscar ejecuciones de una instancia",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/executions?processInstanceId={{processInstanceId}}&messageEventSubscriptionName={{mensaje}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "executions"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "processInstanceId",
                  "value": "{{processInstanceId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "messageEventSubscriptionName",
                  "value": "{{mensaje}}",
                  "description": "Nombre del mensaje, p. ej. Aceptación, Rechazo, Solicitud de modificaciones. Si la lista viene vacía, ese mensaje no está habilitado ahora. Guardá data[0].id en executionId."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Opcional: muestra las ejecuciones que esperan el mensaje {{mensaje}}. Los requests de abajo ya hacen esta busqueda solos."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Aceptar propuesta (con fecha)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"messageEventReceived\",\n  \"messageName\": \"Aceptación\",\n  \"variables\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"fechaCurso\",\n      \"value\": \"{{fechaCurso}}\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/runtime/executions/{{executionId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "runtime",
                "executions",
                "{{executionId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "La fecha se calcula sola (ahora + 5 min). Sin fechaCurso la aceptacion se acepta, pero despues falla \"Definir docente\"."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Busca sola la ejecucion a la que hay que enviar la comunicacion (no hay que copiar executionId a mano).",
                  "const base=pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl'), pid=pm.collectionVariables.get('processInstanceId');",
                  "const auth='Basic '+CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(pm.collectionVariables.get('usuario')+':'+pm.collectionVariables.get('clave')));",
                  "pm.sendRequest({url: base+'/runtime/executions?processInstanceId='+pid+'&'+'messageEventSubscriptionName='+encodeURIComponent('Aceptación'), method:'GET', header:{Authorization:auth}}, (err,res)=>{",
                  "  const data = err ? [] : (res.json().data || []);",
                  "  if (data.length === 1) { pm.variables.set('executionId', data[0].id); }",
                  "  else { console.error('El mensaje \"Aceptación\" NO esta habilitado en esta instancia ahora (ejecuciones encontradas: '+data.length+'). Revisa processInstanceId y el estado del proceso.'); pm.variables.set('executionId','NO_HABILITADO'); }",
                  "});",
                  "// Fecha acordada: dentro de 5 minutos (ISO 8601 UTC). Cambiala por otra si queres.",
                  "pm.variables.set('fechaCurso', new Date(Date.now()+5*60*1000).toISOString().slice(0,19)+'Z');"
                ]
              }
